# ============================================
# Dataset DATA (user-provided images, do not commit)
# NOTE: ignore everything under data/ EXCEPT the fixed ID/OOD
# class split files (pkl / id_classes.json) — they are part of
# the experimental protocol and MUST be committed.
# The `datasets/` CODE package and `envisioned_classes/`
# (pre-generated LLM label JSONs) must also be committed.
# ============================================
data/*
!data/Boat-14/
!data/Boat-14/id_classes.json
!data/CUB-100/
!data/CUB-100/selected_100_classes.pkl
!data/Stanford-Cars-98/
!data/Stanford-Cars-98/selected_98_classes.pkl
!data/Food-50/
!data/Food-50/selected_50_classes.pkl
!data/Oxford-Pet-18/
!data/Oxford-Pet-18/selected_18_classes.pkl

